{
  "_help": [
    "handTools : utensils hanging on the wall rail. Drag one onto food (or a stack of food) to use it.",
    "            The hands have \"menu\": true, so they offer every hand action that makes sense (knead, squeeze, peel…).",
    "            op = what it does: knead, chop, whisk, mix, roll, mash, grate, grind.",
    "appliances: the big tools on the counter. Drop food (or a stack) into one to cook it.",
    "            op = boil, fry, bake, blend, grill, steam, freeze, marinate, age, plate.",
    "            The plate collects up to 'slots' things; press Serve to call the critic.",
    "pantry    : the sections of the pantry, and which ingredient categories ('cat' in ingredients.json) go in each."
